{"2735270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hardware Dev", "steam_appid": 2735270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, create, and manage your own tech business in Hardware Dev.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devices your way by carefully selecting each component. Experiment with different combinations, adjust details like size and design, and create unique products that match your vision. As you progress, you will unlock new options that expand your possibilities and improve your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not just about designing: you will also need to manage your company. Organize your office as you like, place furniture strategically, and optimize space to hire more employees and increase productivity. Need more space? Expand your facilities and take your business to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find new components, analyze product reviews, and improve your designs based on customer feedback. You can even add small details, like gifts, to offer a more complete experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hardware Dev, every decision matters: from designing your devices to organizing your company. Will you be able to create the ultimate tech business?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, create, and manage your own tech business in Hardware Dev.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devices your way by carefully selecting each component. Experiment with different combinations, adjust details like size and design, and create unique products that match your vision. As you progress, you will unlock new options that expand your possibilities and improve your creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not just about designing: you will also need to manage your company. Organize your office as you like, place furniture strategically, and optimize space to hire more employees and increase productivity. Need 